========================================================================
SUMMARY
========================================================================

Method: Explicit enumeration of ALL n! permutations (no bitmask DP)

Results:
  1. W(n) sequence independently verified for n=1..8:
     W = [1, 2, 8, 32, 158, 928, 6350, 49752]

  2. W(n)/n! = 1 + CV^2(n) verified for n=3..8 using
     the Delannoy formula:
       CV^2 = sum_{k=1}^{floor((n-1)/2)} 2*g_k(n-2k) / (n)_{2k}
     where g_k(m) = sum_{j=1}^{min(k,m)} C(k-1,j-1)*C(m,j)*2^{j-1}

  3. Both methods agree exactly (rational arithmetic, no floating point).

VERIFICATION STATUS: PASSED
